abstract: >-
  Analysis code for controlled comparisons that use short ordinal instruments
  administered to practitioners. It covers equivalence testing against a
  declared margin, multiplicity control across instrument items, declared
  response integrity screening reported as a sensitivity family, and inference
  for clustered and partially paired samples. The repository also carries the
  drivers, the column map and the run provenance for the lesson planning study
  of 2026, so that each reported estimate can be traced to the code state and
  the parameter values behind it.
keywords:
  - equivalence testing
  - ordinal instruments
  - cluster bootstrap
  - response integrity
  - sensitivity analysis
  - reproducible research
